{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1JN","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"约翰一书","commonName":"约翰一书","title":"约翰一书","order":62,"numberOfChapters":5,"sha256":"36f7b01a8dc8af24ba6d0a85d7a7d1397a8ff1afea602248a113c9d5bf274b00","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1JN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":5,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1JN/5.json","totalNumberOfVerses":104},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["生命之道"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["关于从太初就已经存在的生命之道，我们曾经耳闻目睹，亲眼看过，亲手摸过。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["这生命曾显现过，我们看见了，现在做见证，向你们传扬这与父同在、曾向我们显现的永恒生命。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我们把所见所闻传给你们，好使你们可以与我们相交。我们诚然是与父和祂儿子耶稣基督相交。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我们把这些话写给你们，好使大家都喜乐满溢。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["要活在光中"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["我们从耶稣那里听见、现在又传给你们的信息就是：上帝是光，在祂里面毫无黑暗。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["我们如果说与祂相交，却仍活在黑暗里，就是说谎，没有遵行真理。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我们如果生活在光明中，像上帝在光明中一样，就彼此相交，祂儿子耶稣的血就洗净我们一切的罪。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我们如果说自己没有罪，便是自欺，真理就不在我们里面。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["如果我们承认自己的罪，上帝是信实和公义的，必赦免我们的罪，洗净我们一切的不义。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我们如果说自己没有犯过罪，就是把上帝看作说谎的，祂的道也不在我们里面。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1JN/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1JN/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2PE/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}